<% this.title = '批量导入题目'; this.active = 'problems'; %>
<% include app_header %>
<main class="app-page app-problem-bulk-import-page"><header class="app-page-header"><div class="app-page-heading"><a class="app-back-link" href="<%= syzoj.utils.makeUrl(['problems']) %>"><i data-lucide="arrow-left"></i>返回题库</a><span class="app-kicker">PROBLEM LIBRARY</span><h1 class="app-page-title">批量导入题目</h1><p class="app-page-description">上传 ZIP 题目包，一次创建多道题目；每个题目文件夹可包含 Markdown 题面和测试数据。</p></div><div class="app-page-actions"><a class="app-button app-button-secondary" href="<%= syzoj.utils.makeUrl(['problems', 'import', 'template']) %>" download><i data-lucide="download"></i>下载 ZIP 格式示例</a></div></header><section class="app-section"><div class="app-notice app-notice-info"><i data-lucide="info"></i><span>ZIP 根目录下每个文件夹代表一道题目：放置 <code>statement.md</code>（或 <code>problem.md</code>）、可选的 <code>problem.json</code> 和 <code>testdata.zip</code>。最多 100 个文件夹。</span></div><form class="app-form" id="problem-bulk-import-form" data-problem-bulk-import><label class="app-file-field"><input type="file" name="problems_zip" accept=".zip,application/zip" required><span><i data-lucide="file-archive"></i><strong>选择题目 ZIP</strong><small>每个题目文件夹包含题面与可选测试数据</small></span></label><div class="app-form-actions"><span class="app-form-status" data-bulk-import-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></span><button class="app-button app-button-primary" type="submit"><i data-lucide="upload"></i><span>开始导入</span></button></div></form><div class="app-bulk-import-preview" data-bulk-import-preview hidden><div class="app-section-header"><div><h2 class="app-section-title">导入预览</h2><p class="app-section-description" data-bulk-import-count></p></div></div><p class="app-bulk-import-names" data-bulk-import-names></p></div></section><section class="app-section"><div class="app-section-header"><div><h2 class="app-section-title">文件夹格式</h2><p class="app-section-description">每个题目目录至少包含一个 Markdown 题面文件；测试数据请打包为同目录下的 <code>testdata.zip</code>。</p></div></div><div class="app-table-region"><table class="app-table"><thead><tr><th>文件</th><th>作用</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>statement.md</code></td><td>题面</td><td>必填，也可使用 <code>problem.md</code>。</td></tr><tr><td><code>problem.json</code></td><td>题目属性</td><td>可选，填写 title、type、限制、标签等字段。</td></tr><tr><td><code>testdata.zip</code></td><td>测试数据</td><td>可选，格式与题目测试数据上传一致。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></main>
<script>(function(){var form=document.querySelector('[data-problem-bulk-import]');if(!form)return;var input=form.elements.problems_zip,status=form.querySelector('[data-bulk-import-status]'),button=form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');function setStatus(message,kind){status.textContent=message||'';status.className='app-form-status'+(kind?' app-form-status-'+kind:'')}function failureMessage(data){var error=data&&data.error,fields=error&&error.fields,failures=fields&&fields.failures||data&&data.data&&data.data.failures||[];if(failures.length)return failures.map(function(item){return item.folder+'：'+item.message}).join('；');return error&&error.message||data&&data.message||'ZIP 导入失败。'}input.addEventListener('change',function(){var file=input.files&&input.files[0];setStatus(file?('已选择 '+file.name+'，提交后服务器会校验每个题目文件夹。'):'')});form.addEventListener('submit',async function(event){event.preventDefault();var file=input.files&&input.files[0];if(!file){setStatus('请选择 ZIP 文件。','error');return}button.disabled=true;setStatus('正在上传并导入 ZIP…');try{var body=new FormData();body.append('problems_zip',file);var response=await fetch('<%= syzoj.utils.makeUrl(['api', 'v2', 'problems', 'import']) %>',{method:'POST',credentials:'same-origin',body:body}),data=null;try{data=await response.json()}catch(error){}if(!response.ok)throw new Error(failureMessage(data));var created=Number(data.data&&data.data.created||0),failed=Number(data.data&&data.data.failed||0);if(failed){setStatus('已创建 '+created+' 道，失败 '+failed+' 道：'+failureMessage(data),'error');button.disabled=false;return}setStatus('已创建 '+created+' 道题目。','success');window.setTimeout(function(){window.location.assign('<%= syzoj.utils.makeUrl(['problems']) %>?bulk_imported='+created)},500)}catch(error){setStatus(error.message,'error');button.disabled=false}})})();</script>
<p class="app-help">测试数据也可以直接放在题目文件夹的 <code>testdata/</code> 目录中，系统会自动打包后导入。</p>
<% include app_footer %>
